.TH AD_SNAPSHOT 1 "2026-09-10" "ad 2.0" "ad scripts"
.SH NAME
ad_snapshot \- per-op HTML snapshots of the animator buffer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ad_snapshot
[\fIoptions\fR] <oldfile> <newfile>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ad_snapshot
runs the ad pipeline
.RI ( compute \(-> postprocess \(-> pace )
on an old/new file pair, then takes a snapshot of the animator's buffer
after every keep / delete / insert op and renders all those snapshots
into a single browsable HTML page (one entry per op, with the changed
character highlighted).
.PP
The HTML page is written to
.IR /tmp/ad_snapshots/snapshots.html .
Open it in a browser to step through the animation op-by-op.
.PP
.B ad_snapshot
accepts all
.BR ad_vim (1)
options in addition to its own (see below). Routed pipeline options:
.RS
.IP \(bu 3
.B \-\-indent-last ,
.B \-\-overwrite ,
.B \-\-line-delete-in-place ,
.B \-\-ad-layer ,
.B \-\-ad-layer-path
\(-> postprocess
.IP \(bu 3
.B \-\-delete-pacing ,
.B \-\-insert-pacing ,
.B \-\-delete-speed ,
.B \-\-insert-speed ,
.B \-\-pacing ,
.B \-\-cursor-glide-ms ,
.B \-\-distance-speed ,
.B \-\-flash-pause-ms ,
.B \-\-flash-highlight-ms
\(-> pace
.IP \(bu 3
.B \-\-highlight ,
.B \-\-dim-unchanged ,
.B \-\-fold-unchanged ,
.B \-\-sign-column ,
.B \-\-git-blame
\(-> decorate
.IP \(bu 3
.B \-\-diff-stat ,
.B \-\-diff-highlight ,
.B \-\-bell ,
.B \-\-scroll
\(-> animator
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h , " \-\-help"
Show detailed help and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-show\-keep
Show keep ops in the snapshot stream (default: hidden). When hidden,
each delete/insert entry still shows the buffer state (the result after
the op was applied).
.TP
.B \-\-show\-pacing
Include delay (pace) ops in the snapshot stream (default: excluded).
.TP
.BI \-\-context\  N
Show only N lines of context around the changed line (default: -1 = show
whole buffer; 0 = show only the changed line).
.TP
.B \-\-frame\-op
Show a frame/border around each op entry (default: off).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-buffer\-frame
Remove the buffer border (default: on).
.TP
.BI \-\-font\-size\  N
Font size in px (default: 14).
.TP
.B \-\-trace
Enable the op-tracing debugging UI.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Basic usage:
.B ad_snapshot old.py new.py
.TP
With word-delete pacing and inline highlight:
.B ad_snapshot \-\-delete-pacing word \-\-highlight inline old.py new.py
.TP
Open the result:
.BR "xdg-open /tmp/ad_snapshots/snapshots.html" .
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR ad_vim (1),
.BR ad_pipeline (1),
.BR ad (1)
